om/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7933","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7933","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7933.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7933.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-09T05:06:28Z"},"body":"Design note for #6005: doc/2026-11-09_design_id6005_moderation_pack_format.md\n\nSpecifies the data-only moderation pack format for #5973 to adopt:\n- Pack identity: pkgs/id signed-object shape, author-key pinning, BLAKE3 pack_id from the genesis object; forks are new packs, never silent variants.\n- Static shareable core: rules (rule_id/subject/match/action/note) and feed subscriptions incorporated by reference to the #6006 feed protocol §5 contract — no feed protocol restated.\n- Per-world parameter block (separate object, world-signed): report_quarantine_threshold, moderators, reviewers, local_exemptions reference, appeal_window; parameters tune thresholds/people/windows and can never rewrite rules.\n- Serialization: KDL authoring form in the #5753 manifest profile; canonical form, hashing and signing under the #5906 KDL/JSON contract — no new serialization.\n- Versioning/compatibility: format_version, complete-core versions, world-side acceptance of new versions, breaking-change rules.\n- Local lists stay world state and always win.\n\nDocs-only; no runtime code. Issue #6005 stays open until this lands, per its acceptance criteria.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796787082&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7933&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7933&signature=f6b5b113f6b940a5bfdb46b74f43ea75ef4e4ec16b02901e7f4cede24a616dd7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7933?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7933/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9344","id":6365601286,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABO1oqIQ","number":9344,"title":"feat(mcpx): return final exec expression for #1937","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-11-13T05:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:16:20Z","closed_at":"2026-11-13T10:09:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/9344","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9344","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9344.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/9344.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-13T10:09:05Z"},"body":"Fixes #1937 (queue task 9316). Completes the remaining CODE-19 behavior; CODE-30/CODE-35 and CODE-36 already landed in #9205 and #9299.\n\n## What changed\n\n- For inline exec snippets only, conservatively identify a final top-level expression statement and rewrite it to report its value through the generated client. Declarations, blocks, default-export entrypoints, and unclassifiable source keep their existing behavior.\n- Keep final-expression values separate from stdout and `emit()` records; the final expression takes precedence over stdout JSON parsing. `undefined` preserves the stdout fallback.\n- Gate rewriting on the client capability marker so custom/older clients without `__mcpxFinal` are unaffected.\n- Document CODE-19 in the script/exec guides and register.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cd pkgs/mcpx && go test ./internal/runner ./internal/execsvc ./internal/codegen ./internal/logging -count=1` — pass\n- Same packages with `-race -shuffle=on -count=5` — pass\n- `gofmt` and `git diff --check` — clean\n\nThe task worktree was based on the merged #9299 head and includes the current `origin/main` merge.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797140566&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=9344&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F9344&signature=f2a1ecd62d8fbbcec62d2231dd4c88981eb9660defef94cd234cec57ebc87bae\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/9344?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * `mcpx exec` now uses a snippet’s final top-level expression as its result when available. If no expression result is available, stdout continues to provide the result.\n  * Execution output reports the final result separately from stdout and artifacts, preserving explicit `null` results.\n  * Successful and error-handling hooks can provide or replace the final result.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated script and execution guides to explain how final expressions, stdout, and stderr are handled.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/9344/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}